C*    Converted to lower case and prettified throughout by MLA Apr 1980.
C*    Requires the common block insert file STARTREK.INS.FTN in this UFD.
C*    64V mode meant to be split into segment 4000. If not splitting,
C*    remove the 'SUBROUTINE MAIN' line below.
C*    Rev.19.1, GGR version 14 Oct 83.
C*
C*********************************************************************
C*                                                                   *
C*                       THE STAR TREK GAME                          *
C*                               BY                                  *
C*               DAVID MATUSZEK AND PAUL REYNOLDS                    *
